+  <text x="510" y="118" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="12.5" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">recover the scalar from the point</text>
+  <text x="510" y="154" text-anchor="middle" fill="#ff8080" font-size="14.5" font-weight="800" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">&#10007; the discrete log problem</text>
